      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been dealing with some pretty bad kidney stones lately (calcium oxalate ones) and i really wanna just detox and get my health on track. i was thinking about starting a high dose vitamin c supplement, like 2500mg or even 3000mg a day, to help clean things out and boost my immunity. do u think that would be a good idea for my kidney health?",
