      "content": "While high doses of vitamin C may support overall immune function, it's crucial to consult your healthcare provider before making significant changes to your supplementation routine, particularly given your kidney stones. High doses over an extended period can sometimes lead to side effects or interact with certain medications. A balanced approach to diet and recommended supplements is often optimal for kidney health and overall wellness.",
